The '''Corens''' ([[wikipedia:IPA|IPA]]: /tsorɛns/; [[Ottelian language|Ottelian]] 𐐧𐐬𐐸𐐫𐑅, ''Corhõs''; [[Qymish language|Qymish]]: Ⱚⱁⱃⰰⱜⰰ, ''Coraja'') are the major heroes of [[Mankind]] in [[Scildism]], commonly considered to be [[Sluj]], [[Meliv]], [[Suga]], [[Nats]], [[Nojed]], [[Tolikar]], [[Mabush]], [[Kiredef]], [[Najard]], [[Elak]], and [[Niark]]. Besides the Corens, there are countless other cultic heroes in Scildism. 

The Corens also each represent one of the eleven months in the [[Bachan calendar]]. 

